  "notable_quotes": [
    "At 195 K, degassed 1 showed a type-I CO2 isotherm without hysteresis, with 622 m2 g−1 Langmuir area and 0.21 cm3 g−1 pore volume.",
    "The H2btm ligand with tetrahedral Zn(II) leaves two triazolate N-donors uncoordinated, creating molecular-claw guest binding sites in a 3D framework.",
    "Monodentate CO2 binding sites are a tradeoff: physical adsorption is reversible but low-affinity/selectivity, while chemical absorption hinders CO2 release."
  ],
